*     FAP                                                                       
       LBL     IEXP                                                     IEXP0000
       COUNT   40                                                       IEXP0001
*      U. OF CHICAGO COMPLEX EXPONENTIAL ROUTINE                        IEXP0002
*                  NORMALIZED ARGUMENTS ARE GIVEN AS FOLLOWS            IEXP0003
*                 REAL PART IN CELL 32767, IMAGINARY PART IN 32766      IEXP0004
*                 ANSWER WILL APPEAR IN SAME CELLS                      IEXP0005
*             ROUTINE IS ENTERED BY A TSX   $IEXP,4  OR   CALL  IEXP    IEXP0006
       ENTRY   IEXP                                                     IEXP0007
       SPACE                                                            IEXP0008
  IEXP SXA     X4,4          SAVE INDEX 4                               IEXP0009
       CLA     4)            REAL PART                                  IEXP0010
       CALL    EXP             = E**X(COSX)                             IEXP0011
       STO     BUF                                                      IEXP0012
       CLA     4)-1                                                     IEXP0013
       CALL    COS                                                      IEXP0014
       XCA                                                              IEXP0015
       FMP     BUF                                                      IEXP0016
       FRN                   STORE REAL PART                            IEXP0017
       STO     4)                                                       IEXP0018
       CLA     4)-1          IMAGINARY PART                             IEXP0019
       CALL    SIN             = E**X(SINX)                             IEXP0020
       XCA                                                              IEXP0021
       FMP     BUF                                                      IEXP0022
       FRN                   STORE IMAGINARY                            IEXP0023
       STO     4)-1            PART                                     IEXP0024
    X4 AXT     **,4          RESET INDEX                                IEXP0025
       TRA     1,4           RETURN TO MAIN PROGRAM                     IEXP0026
   BUF PZE                                                              IEXP0027
    4) EQU     -1                                                       IEXP0028
       END                                                              IEXP0029
